Subject: [PATCH 2/5] plugins: add ARCPhotonDetectionFilter for the ARC SiPM
 efficiency

Sensitive-detector filter that keeps an optical photon reaching an ARC
sensor with probability PDE(E) and kills it otherwise. Needed because the
ARC setup runs with BoundaryInvokeSD = false, so a surface EFFICIENCY is
never applied by Geant4. Default table: ARC_SiPM_QuantumEfficiency.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KP5vqAGH2XiGXWtPhaonke
